          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: سمت",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "سمت — simt — \"a direction\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "اسٹیشن کس سمت میں ہے؟ isṭeshan kis simt meṅ hai? Which direction is the station in?"
